// A shadow declaration is a differently sized view of another local's
// storage: the serializer creates one when a use of a variable has a width
// other than the variable's.  It carries a size, no type, and (from a current
// serializer) the key of the local it views and the byte offset inside it.
// It used to be dropped, taking every operation that used it along.
//
//   word_0   1 byte at offset 0 of `word`: lifted as *(unsigned char *)&word
//   word_1   2 bytes at offset 2 of `word`
//   word_2   8 bytes, wider than the 4-byte `word`: cannot be a view
//   legacy_3 older JSON, no `shadow_of`: nothing to tie it to
//
// The last two become objects of their own and are reported, a warning by
// default and an error under -strict.
//
// RUN: bash %strip-json-comments %s > %t.json
// RUN: %patchir-decomp -input %t.json -emit-llvm -print-tu -output %t > %t.log 2>&1
// RUN: %file-check -vv -check-prefix=WARN %s --input-file %t.log
// RUN: %file-check -vv -check-prefix=C %s --input-file %t.c
// RUN: test -e %t.ll
// RUN: not %patchir-decomp -input %t.json -emit-cir -strict -output %t.strict > %t.strict.log 2>&1
// RUN: %file-check -vv -check-prefix=ERR %s --input-file %t.strict.log
// RUN: test ! -e %t.strict.cir
//
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [local-view-detached]: local 'word_2' in function 'shadow_views' is a view (8 bytes) of local 'word' that cannot be tied to it
// WARN-DAG: Diag Warning: {{.*}}lossy lift [local-view-detached]: local 'legacy_3' in function 'shadow_views' is a view (2 bytes) of another local that cannot be tied to it
// WARN-NOT: lossy lift [op-dropped]
// WARN-NOT: Diag Error
// WARN-NOT: local 'word_0'
// WARN-NOT: local 'word_1'
//
// C: unsigned int word;
// C: word = a;
// C: (*(unsigned char *)&word) = 127U;
// C: (*(unsigned short *)((unsigned char *)&word + 2U)) = 4660U;
// C: word_2 = 1ULL;
// C: legacy_3 = 2U;
// C: return word;
//
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [local-view-detached]: local 'word_2'
// ERR-DAG: Diag Error: {{.*}}lossy lift [local-view-detached]: local 'legacy_3'
